invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: ch_rsa_key_from_pem stops requiring each prime's top bit, which
  rsa_sign.h's key form requires. Under the ladder no signature reads p,
  so a prime with its top bit clear decodes. test_written writes one.

--- old
    return ok & (int)tops;
--- new
    (void)tops;
    return ok;
